<title>UK: London gold fixes touch firmer on short covering.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes touch firmer on short covering.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $332.30 vs $332.15 previously. Fairly quiet. Some short covering overnight partly countered by producer selling. May firm ahead of U.S. holiday weekend.</p>
<p>SILVER - Steady and barely changed at $4.64/$4.66.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Unchanged at $423.00/$426.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - About $2.00 easier at $188.00/$193.00</p>
